# autonomous-loop local state (created at runtime, never committed)
# cooldown.json holds per-agent rate-limit reset times; lock files coordinate
# task claims; shots/ + reject/ are mobile-approval artifacts;
# knowledge-overlay.json holds local knowledge tool adoption feedback.
.harness/
current_tasks/*.lock
current.md

# Agent local configs & shared skills
/.agents/*
# !/.agents/skills/ (disabled for public repository)
# 행동 스펙은 프로젝트가 소유하고 리뷰하는 계약이다 — 무시하면 배포되지 않는다.
# !/.agents/behaviors/ (disabled for public repository)

# local runtime logs & test artifacts
logs/
*.bundle
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/

# Note: Harness isolation patterns are auto-applied when repository is public (or via ca isolate)

